  "description": "One day Sangha was suddenly kidnapped on her way home and murdered. During her final moments all she could look at was the wishing bracelet she had, the one she used to wish that someday she could be with the person she loves the most. With that being her last memory before fainting, Sangha suddenly wakes up four months before her death, Knowing that her death is already set, she decides to fulfill her wish and be with the man she loves, Her \"Dad\" which has a particular relationship with her.\n\n(Source: Lezhin, translated)",
